{"symbol":"GKI.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:33Z","info":{"address1":"Plac Koscieleckich 3","city":"Bydgoszcz","zip":"85-033","country":"Poland","phone":"48 52 561 2330","fax":"48 52 321 0078","website":"https://www.immobile.com.pl","industry":"Conglomerates","industryKey":"conglomerates","industryDisp":"Conglomerates","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Grupa Kapitalowa IMMOBILE S.A. operates in industry, construction, automation and power engineering, hospitality, and development industries in Poland and internationally. The company manufactures and distributes handling systems; engages in the business of automatic car parks; offers crushing and grinding machines under the MAKRUM brand, as well as warehouse equipment, such as forklifts and warehouse racks; and sells aluminum facades, aluminum joinery, lift and slide doors, and fire protection products. It also constructs housing estates; operates hotels; is involved in the business of industrial construction, modern offices, commercial facilities, and development investment; carries out general investment implementation (GRI); and offers IT solutions including supporting logistics, streamlining document flow and archiving, and visualizing technological processes, as well as equipment used in I and C, and related systems. In addition, the company provides professional advisory services; engineering services in the field of industrial automation, control and measurement equipment, computer science, telemetry, telecommunications, electricity, gas, cogeneration systems, water and sewage networks, air conditioning, regulation, electronics, and metrology; installation, ventilation, and heating services; and low, medium, and high-voltage power generation services to customers in the construction, industrial, and energy sectors. The company was formerly known as MAKRUM S.A. and changed its name to Grupa Kapitalowa IMMOBILE S.A. in 2014. Grupa Kapitalowa IMMOBILE S.A. was founded in 1868 and is based in Bydgoszcz, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":41,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Rafal Maria Jerzy","title":"President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1394000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Fortuna","title":"CFO & Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":455000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Mikolaj  Jerzy","title":"Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":12000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pawel  Mirski","title":"Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":1108000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Beata Elzbiet Jerzy","title":"Secretary of the Supervisory Board & Member of the Supervisory Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":20000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":4,"previousClose":4.19,"open":4.3,"dayLow":4.2,"dayHigh":4.3,"regularMarketPreviousClose":4.19,"regularMarketOpen":4.3,"regularMarketDayLow":4.2,"regularMarketDayHigh":4.3,"dividendRate":0.13,"dividendYield":3.1,"exDividendDate":1789084800,"payoutRatio":0,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.34,"beta":0.48,"trailingPE":5.86301,"volume":5391,"regularMarketVolume":5391,"averageVolume":13049,"averageVolume10days":15340,"averageDailyVolume10Day":15340,"bid":4.23,"ask":4.28,"marketCap":314361312,"nonDilutedMarketCap":307750895,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":2.97,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":5.38,"allTimeHigh":9,"allTimeLow":0.84,"fulldayPrice":4.28,"fulldayChange":0.0900002,"fulldayChangePercent":2.14798,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.290232,"fiftyDayAverage":4.6406,"twoHundredDayAverage":4.6396,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":0.13,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0310263,"currency":"PLN","tradeable":false,"enterpriseValue":839201920,"profitMargins":0.04108,"floatShares